          "version": "7.0.1"
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Reference\n\n```\nIDF  : txt2img-basic-fx10-sdvq\nIDI  : T2I-BAS_FX10_SDVQ\nT2I  : Text to image\nFX10 : Flux.1\nSVDQ : Singular Value Decomposition Quantization\nCDL  : Clip Dual\n```\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=26WaK9Vl0Bg\n\n# Models\n\n## Diffusion Models (GGUF)\n\n📂 models / diffusion_models\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-GGUF/resolve/main/LowNoise/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-LowNoise-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-LowNoise-Q8_0.gguf [other versions](https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-GGUF/tree/main/LowNoise)\n\n📂 models / lora\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning/resolve/main/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-4steps-lora-rank64-Seko-V1.1/low_noise_model.safetensors?download=true) low_noise_model.safetensors\n\nMore about Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-4steps-lora-rank64-Seko-V1.1 lora [HERE](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning/tree/main/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-4steps-lora-rank64-Seko-V1.1)\n\n## Clip Loader\n\n📂 models / text_encoders\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true) umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n\n## VAE\n\n📂 models / vae\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors?download=true) wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n\n# Custom Nodes\n\n- **ComfyUI-GGUF**\n- **ComfyUI-KJNodes**\n- **rgthree-comfy**\n- **ControlAltAI_Nodes**\n- **ComfyUI-Easy-Use**\n\n- [ComfyUI rgthree](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)\n- [ComfyUI Easy Use](https://github.com/yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use)\n- [ComfyUI Custom Scripts](https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts)\n- [ComfyUI TiledDiffusion](https://github.com/shiimizu/ComfyUI-TiledDiffusion)\n- [ComfyUI Image Size Tools](https://github.com/TheLustriVA/ComfyUI-Image-Size-Tools)\n- [ComfyUI GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF)\n- [ComfyUI TeaCache](https://github.com/welltop-cn/ComfyUI-TeaCache)\n\n# Resources\n- [Github](https://github.com/yaiol/ComfyUI-Workflows)\n- [SVDQuant: Absorbing Outliers by Low-Rank Components for 4-Bit Diffusion Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.05007)\n\n\n\n\n"
      ],
